          Gazetteer-based NER with three categories: <strong>Person</strong>, <strong>Place</strong>, <strong>Org</strong>.
          In Python and WASM, NE tags are accessed via <code class="text-sm bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">segment_fts()</code>.
