        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-1">
          Sentence boundary detection. Splits on newlines, Thai markers (ฯ ๚ ๛),
          and Western punctuation (<code class="text-sm bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">! ? .</code> followed by space).
          Each sentence span carries char offsets for Python/JS string slicing.
        </p>
